Source: openssl@STREAM@-upstream
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OpenSSL Packages <openssl-packages@openssl.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 12~), perl
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://openssl-library.org

Package: openssl@STREAM@-upstream
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: no
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates
Description: OpenSSL @STREAM@ upstream build (installed under /opt)
 Official upstream OpenSSL @STREAM@, built from pristine source with the
 default feature set and installed under /opt/openssl/@STREAM@ so that it
 coexists with — and never interferes with — the distribution's own
 OpenSSL. Configuration lives under /etc/opt/openssl/@STREAM@.
 .
 Source this stream's enable script to put it on PATH:
   source /opt/openssl/@STREAM@/enable

Package: openssl@STREAM@-upstream-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: no
Depends: openssl@STREAM@-upstream (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: OpenSSL @STREAM@ upstream build (development files)
 Headers, pkg-config and CMake files, static libraries, the link-time
 shared-object symlinks, API/guide man pages and the source demos for
 OpenSSL @STREAM@ installed under /opt/openssl/@STREAM@.
 .
 The guides (ossl-guide-*) reference the demos, which are shipped under
 /opt/openssl/@STREAM@/share/doc.
